# Mechanism: pre-release-documentation

command: python3 -B scripts/check-pre-release-documentation.py RID-002
inputs:
  - .cairn/mechanisms
  - .cairn/reviews
  - .cairn/backlog
  - docs
  - manual
  - include
  - bindings
  - src
  - crates
  - reactive-tui-macros
  - verification
  - scripts
  - README.md
  - AGENTS.md
  - CHANGELOG.md
  - .gitignore
  - Cargo.toml
  - Cargo.lock
requirements:
  - RID-002

The checker MUST reject missing, untracked, or ignored mechanism inputs,
unrecognized legacy declarations, and missing or untracked local link targets.
Fixtures MUST cover images, reference links, HTML links, headings, encoded
repository escapes, and tracked-but-ignored files. External URLs and fenced
examples are not local repository targets.

After this inspection passes, run every maintained mechanism against the
committed relocated tree and commit its fresh receipts and output. Final
review MUST verify the complete inventory and freshness; a static link-check
pass is not proof that all acceptance checks ran.
